- Principal and Super Admin permissions work correctly.
- Secretary permissions work correctly.
- Existing login, authentication, and session handling still work.
- Existing unrelated modules continue working.
- No demo students are created.
- Database migrations preserve existing data.

Run available type checks, the production build, and relevant tests. Fix failures caused by the implementation.

Do not claim that a test passed unless it was actually executed.

